WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.540
if every time you showed up to work,

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:03.440
masked militants tried to kill you.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.280
Because that's how we feel.

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:05.840
That's our lived reality.

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.360
And you guys go and tell us that we're liars,

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.560
the riots aren't that bad, right?

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.220
I've never seen any of you guys on the ground.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.880
In fact, I've never seen anybody representing

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.500
the companies you work for on the ground.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.520
You guys come to us for interviews that never get published.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.799
Stop saying we're lying.

00:00:21.799 --> 00:00:22.639
We're not.

00:00:22.639 --> 00:00:25.000
We risk our lives every day to do the job

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.799
that you guys are too afraid to do.

